{
  "description": "The Google connectors: Gmail, Google Calendar and Google Drive into the Library (docs/spec/google-connectors.md, plan docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-31-google-connectors-plan.md). Rows: POST /kb/google/start, GET /kb/google/status, GET /kb/google/accounts, POST /kb/google/disconnect, POST /kb/google/options, GET /kb/google/calendars, GET /kb/google/drive/folders, POST /kb/google/gmail/fetch, POST /kb/google/gmail/seen, POST /kb/google/sync. Served by extension/routes/google-connectors.mjs, dispatched from extension/routes/router.mjs; always on (no LLMIDE_FEATURES key). Token-protected and user-scoped. Google sign-in here is a connector credential only: never an app login, never a model provider. No response carries a token, a client secret or a raw Google body: the OAuth client and the refresh token live in the per-user vault (google.acct.<id>.*), the access token in memory. Fixtures are the real handler's responses (in-process, tests/google-routes.test.mjs with GOOGLE_DUMP_FIXTURES) with Google answered by recorded fixtures under extension/tests/fixtures/google; no fixture reached a Google host. The ids, port, state, batch id and timestamps are normalised to example values. Not captured: the 502 upstream failures (they need Google), listed as x-unspecified. Open objects: ConnectorStatus.options and the options request and response are per-product bags whose keys differ by product (additionalProperties true, described in place). The 400 for a malformed JSON body is not declared per route, as SCHEMA.md says.",
  "$defs": {
    "Scope": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "scope": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "tier": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "basic",
            "restricted",
            "sensitive",
            "unknown"
          ],
          "description": "Google's tier label shown in the Connect dialog (unverified against Google's own tables, see the plan)"
        },
        "readOnly": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "enum": [
            true
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "ConnectorStatus": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "idle",
            "pending",
            "syncing",
            "error",
            "reconnect_needed"
          ]
        },
        "lastRunAt": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "lastError": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "a stable code or fixed text, never a response body"
        },
        "options": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "description": "the connector's normalised options; the keys differ by product (gmail: labels, windowDays, includePromotions, includeSocial; gcal: calendarIds, daysBack, daysAhead; gdrive: folderIds, includeSharedDrives), so the object is open"
        }
      }
    },
    "Account": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "accountId": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "email": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "connected",
            "reconnect_needed"
          ]
        },
        "products": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "driveContent": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "scopes": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "connectors": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ConnectorStatus"
          },
          "description": "keyed by product id (gmail, gcal, gdrive), only the granted products"
        }
      }
    },
    "GmailNote": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "threadId": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "noteFile": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "markdown": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "the whole note: JSON-valued frontmatter then the Markdown body, untrusted text escaped, secret shapes redacted"
        },
        "messageCount": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "lastAt": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "Tombstone": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "threadId": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "noteFile": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "line": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "the line to append to the note: deleted upstream <date>"
        }
      }
    },
    "GmailStats": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "threads": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "messages": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "skipped": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "oversize": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "rebootstrapped": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "truncated": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      }
    },
    "CalendarRun": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "calendarId": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "mode": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "full",
            "incremental"
          ]
        },
        "events": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "cancelled": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "resynced": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "pending": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      }
    },
    "DriveStats": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "files": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "removed": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "withContent": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "metadataOnly": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "skippedShared": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "contentSkipped": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "restarted": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "truncated": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "endpoints": {
    "POST /kb/google/start": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "clientId": {
              "type": "string",
              "x-optional": true
            },
            "clientSecret": {
              "type": "string",
              "x-optional": true
            },
            "products": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "driveContent": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "x-optional": true
            },
            "accountId": {
              "type": "string",
              "x-optional": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "authUrl": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "the Google authorization URL; the client opens it in the system browser"
            },
            "state": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "redirectPort": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "expiresInSec": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "scopes": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Scope"
              }
            },
            "legacyMailTokenRevoked": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          }
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "404": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "GET /kb/google/status": {
      "request": {
        "query": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "state": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "pending"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "unknown"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                },
                "message": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "complete"
                  ]
                },
                "accountId": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "email": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "products": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "grantedScopes": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "missingScopes": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "driveContent": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "403": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "GET /kb/google/accounts": {
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "accounts": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Account"
              }
            },
            "legacyMailToken": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "true while the vault still holds the legacy mail.google.com token of /auth/google/*"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "POST /kb/google/disconnect": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "accountId": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "ok": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "revoked": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "false when the revoke call failed (offline); the local credentials are deleted either way"
            },
            "purgedSources": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        },
        "404": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "POST /kb/google/options": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "accountId": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "product": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "options": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "description": "per-product options, validated and clamped by the server; keys as in ConnectorStatus.options"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "ok": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "options": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "description": "the normalised options as stored"
            },
            "contentGranted": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "x-optional": true
            }
          }
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "404": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "409": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "GET /kb/google/calendars": {
      "request": {
        "query": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "accountId": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "calendars": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "summary": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "primary": {
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "accessRole": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "404": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "502": {
          "x-unspecified": "upstream failure from Google (HTTP error, rate limit after retries, malformed response): { error: { code: GOOGLE_*, message } }; producing it needs Google, and the offline tests cover it without capturing a fixture"
        }
      }
    },
    "GET /kb/google/drive/folders": {
      "request": {
        "query": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "accountId": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "parent": {
              "type": "string",
              "x-optional": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "folders": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "502": {
          "x-unspecified": "upstream failure from Google (HTTP error, rate limit after retries, malformed response): { error: { code: GOOGLE_*, message } }; producing it needs Google, and the offline tests cover it without capturing a fixture"
        }
      }
    },
    "POST /kb/google/gmail/fetch": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "accountId": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "accountId": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "batchId": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "confirm with POST /kb/google/gmail/seen after the notes are written"
            },
            "mode": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "bootstrap",
                "history"
              ]
            },
            "pending": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "stats": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/GmailStats"
            },
            "tombstones": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Tombstone"
              }
            },
            "notes": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/GmailNote"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "409": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "502": {
          "x-unspecified": "upstream failure from Google (HTTP error, rate limit after retries, malformed response): { error: { code: GOOGLE_*, message } }; producing it needs Google, and the offline tests cover it without capturing a fixture"
        }
      }
    },
    "POST /kb/google/gmail/seen": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "accountId": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "batchId": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "ok": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "pending": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          }
        },
        "409": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "POST /kb/google/sync": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "accountId": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "product": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "accountId": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "product": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "gcal"
                  ]
                },
                "pending": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "events": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "cancelled": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "calendars": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/CalendarRun"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "accountId": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "product": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "gdrive"
                  ]
                },
                "pending": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "mode": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "bootstrap",
                    "changes"
                  ]
                },
                "stats": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/DriveStats"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "409": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "502": {
          "x-unspecified": "upstream failure from Google (HTTP error, rate limit after retries, malformed response): { error: { code: GOOGLE_*, message } }; producing it needs Google, and the offline tests cover it without capturing a fixture"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
